# Android signing material — losing it means never being able to update the
# published apps, and publishing it would let anyone sign as MS BEAU AVE.
#
# Both halves of that have now happened. The passwords for the two keystores
# below are lost, so neither can sign anything again, and the staff app's first
# key was left in a scratch folder that was wiped — which is why that app had
# to be reissued under a new key that nobody's phone recognised. Keep
# app/mba-staff.jks and its password somewhere that is not a build machine.
android/msbeauave.keystore
android/msbeauave-2026.keystore
android/app/mba-staff.jks
android/*.jks
android/local.properties
android/.gradle/
android/build/
android/app/build/
